Key Analytical Takeaways:
  1. Bare operator A is strictly positive definite and independent of N.
  2. Self-energy Sigma_low(N) = B C^{-1} B^T is positive semidefinite and monotonically increasing in Loewner order.
  3. Ground-state scaling lambda_0 ~ 10^{-43} arises from the near-cancellation A - Sigma_low(N) -> S_low(infty) >= 0.
  4. High modes m >= 12 exhibit power-law / rapid decay, demonstrating exponential shielding of the barrier top.

